━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SurfaceWindow is Window

+ frame-interval Duration = 1s / 60
+ channel-descriptor I32 = 3
+ output-descriptor I32 = 4
_ renderer = MetalOffscreenRenderer(64, 64, 1)
_ scene = DisplayScene(1, transparent, renderer)
_ sender SurfaceSender?
_ requested SurfaceSizeRequest?
_ frame-loop TimerLoop?
_ failure Error?

